        <p>COUNTY BOROUGH OF WARRINGTON. EDUCATION COMMITTEE. • SCHOOLS FOR, WOMEN. To 'meet the requirements of those wishing to pin instruction in Dressmaking, Cookery and Millinery, Classes will be re-opened at ' . EVELYN-STREET SCHOOL, BOLTON SCHOOL. tk-, BEAMONT SCHOOL, ON TUESDAY, ' 26TH SEPTEMBER. Only students 21 years of age and over will be ,adnlitted to these schools. . SICK NURSING. Tshig Class, Well meets at the Technical .15t1tut4 on WEDNESDAY EVENINGS, pre- Li4refi candidates for the British Red ,Cross s Certificates, and also for an Examina- zti n recognised .'by the Army council. BYllabuses and further partiCulars may be obtained from</p>
