        <p>ARE YOU WILLING 'lO PAY 4s. in the ~t INTEREST for Money for Twelve Months? I LEND MONEY ON THESE TERMS. A £5O Loan will cost you £lO for 12 months; a £lOO Loan will cost you £2O for 12 months—other amounts in proportion. I do not advertise ridicu- lous terms, such as is. in the X, which usually means for a period of one month. My terms are in plain English-4s. in the X interest for 32 months. I GUARANTEE YOU ABSOLUTE PRIVACY. and Loans are arranged WITHOUT SECURITY OR SURETIES. All applications receive my personal attenticn, and loans can be granted on the same day as applied for. If desired business will be completed through the not. I am the Actual Lander TRADING IN MY OWN NAME (not assumed or styled as a Bank or Company): you have, therefore, no commissions or fees to pay. A. D. DENNY, 6 and 7, PALL MALL, MANCHESTER. 'Phone 6819 City. Telegrams: "Moderate. Manchester."</p>
