        <p>Grappenhall Detachment.</p>
        <p>Orders for week ending September 30th : MondaY.—MueicetrY at Range, 7.30 p.m.; Range Officer, Section Commander W. Trantom. Tuesday.—Cempany Drill. Fall in at Head- quarters, 7.45 p.m. Wednesday.—lnspection by Field-Marshal Commanding-in-Chief Home Forces, at Chester. Troops will travel on warrant by troop trains detailed in later orders. Inspection at Town Hall. Chester, at 6.25 p.m. Friday.—Musketry at Range, 7.45 p.m.; Range Officer, Sec. Corporal F. Fox. Saturday.—Company Drill (Uniform). Fall in at headquarters 3 p.m. Orderlies.—Section Corporal E. Pearce, Private F. W. Grounds.</p>
